note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note en2goal driver: stdin one English request line, stdout one G line
note (exit 0) or one typed refusal line (exit 20 21 22 23). Exit 2: usage
note (any argument) or a stdin read/stdout write error.
fn main to int
if ne argcnt 1
otpfr 10
otflush
ret 2
end
k = otrdin
if eq k neg long 2
ret 2
end
n = ulong 1024
if ge k 0
n = ulong k
end
code = otengoal n
otflush
ret code
end
